<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Apr 07 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 875, tin down 120, lead down 25, zinc up 5000, aluminium down 3225, nickel up 270, aluminium alloy down 80</p>
